WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.665 --> 01:38.985
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:43.865 --> 01:45.785
Lime caps each cash advance

01:46.305 --> 01:48.705
at 500,000 yuan.

01:50.145 --> 01:55.225
So Dony split it into multiple requests
and successfully bypassed Luke.

02:02.345 --> 02:03.185
Hi, Zhu.

02:03.825 --> 02:05.385
I found out he has a criminal record.

02:06.505 --> 02:07.745
Are you sure?

02:08.744 --> 02:10.465
I scraped the web for information on him.

02:10.545 --> 02:11.905
His real name is Chen Dong.

02:11.985 --> 02:13.625
When he left his previous company,

02:13.705 --> 02:15.665
besides embezzlement, there was also…

02:15.745 --> 02:17.225
IN JUNE 2011, AFTER A COMPANY DINNER

02:17.305 --> 02:18.785
AN EMPLOYEE REPORTED
HE HAD SEXUAL MISCONDUCT

02:21.705 --> 02:22.545
…a sex scandal.

02:23.585 --> 02:24.745
A sex scandal?

02:24.825 --> 02:26.745
What scandal?

02:27.265 --> 02:28.505
Is he married?

02:28.585 --> 02:31.825
He's currently in his third marriage.

02:31.905 --> 02:33.105
A female employee
came forward with evidence.

02:33.705 --> 02:36.225
He may have abused his position
to sexually assault a subordinate.

02:36.745 --> 02:37.705
I see.

02:39.825 --> 02:41.025
Thank you, Zhu.

02:41.665 --> 02:45.185
Thank you for always helping me
when I need it most.

02:45.265 --> 02:46.425
You're welcome.

02:47.305 --> 02:48.945
That's all I can do for you.

02:50.745 --> 02:51.585
Tao.

02:52.705 --> 02:54.265
Please be careful.

02:55.025 --> 02:56.065
Your safety comes first.

02:56.985 --> 02:58.065
Don't worry.

02:58.145 --> 03:00.065
I'm only gathering evidence.

03:00.145 --> 03:01.425
I'll be careful.

03:10.345 --> 03:14.265
COURAGE IS ACTING DESPITE FEAR

03:23.265 --> 03:24.705
What are you doing here?

03:25.585 --> 03:26.625
Did you miss me?

03:27.865 --> 03:31.065
I'm here to back you up.

03:32.585 --> 03:34.785
And to take care of some business.

03:35.625 --> 03:38.105
Did Luke send you?

03:38.185 --> 03:39.345
Smart.

03:40.025 --> 03:42.065
But I can't tell you yet.

03:42.145 --> 03:44.145
Top secret. You know the drill.

03:44.225 --> 03:46.305
I'm glad you're here.

03:46.385 --> 03:47.425
There's definitely

03:48.545 --> 03:49.785
something wrong with Dony.

03:51.105 --> 03:53.145
No wonder you're in management now.

03:53.225 --> 03:54.265
You've got sharp instincts.

03:55.505 --> 03:56.985
What's your plan?

03:58.505 --> 04:03.105
Tell him I'm here
for an urgent special audit.

04:03.185 --> 04:05.865
It's top secret and top priority.

04:08.505 --> 04:09.345
OK.

04:13.345 --> 04:17.025
Lumi looked into the two budget items
Flora flagged.

04:17.105 --> 04:19.425
They were for pu'er tea
purchased as gifts.

04:19.504 --> 04:20.504
Besides that,

04:21.025 --> 04:23.825
he privately contacted
several local shell companies.

04:24.345 --> 04:25.185
Their names are all listed here.

04:31.225 --> 04:33.385
He created sham projects,
inflated the contract prices,

04:34.025 --> 04:36.305
then funneled money to shell companies

04:36.385 --> 04:38.705
through inflated purchases
at affiliated auction houses.

04:39.985 --> 04:41.785
Every step was tightly linked.

04:46.025 --> 04:47.465
Have Lumi keep investigating.

04:47.545 --> 04:49.225
Sure. No problem.

04:57.985 --> 04:59.105
Thanks.

05:02.105 --> 05:04.225
People say Hangzhou
is a culinary wasteland.

05:04.985 --> 05:05.945
I wouldn't say so.

05:06.025 --> 05:07.905
Try this.

05:08.545 --> 05:11.585
Dony, didn't you say
you wanted to discuss work?

05:11.665 --> 05:12.905
What exactly is it?

05:13.985 --> 05:15.545
Don't be so tense.

05:16.065 --> 05:18.545
We work so we can enjoy life.

05:18.625 --> 05:19.665
Eat first.

05:26.625 --> 05:28.505
Then why is he so brazen?

05:28.585 --> 05:31.625
Maybe he's never faced
consequences for it.

05:32.145 --> 05:33.665
Or perhaps he has powerful backing.

05:33.745 --> 05:34.625
It's hard to say.

05:36.385 --> 05:40.785
Why did Lumi come and go in such a hurry?

05:42.545 --> 05:44.225
I don't know the details.

05:44.305 --> 05:47.905
I only know she came to review
the project's progress

05:47.985 --> 05:49.665
and how the budget was being used.

05:54.465 --> 05:57.425
I'm overseeing the Hangzhou project.

05:57.505 --> 05:59.065
Why did she come and interfere?

05:59.145 --> 06:00.825
Did Luke put her up to it?

06:01.985 --> 06:03.185
Sorry, Dony.

06:03.705 --> 06:05.545
I really don't know the details.

06:25.025 --> 06:26.545
PRELIMINARY EVIDENCE ON DONY CHEN'S

06:26.625 --> 06:28.385
SUSPECTED EMBEZZLEMENT
AND PAST SEXUAL HARASSMENT

06:28.465 --> 06:29.505
BANK TRANSFER RECORDS

06:29.585 --> 06:30.865
SCREENSHOTS OF VULGAR
AND SUGGESTIVE MESSAGES

06:30.945 --> 06:33.705
COPIES OF THE VICTIMS' MEDICAL RECORDS

06:45.665 --> 06:46.905
You really don't know?

06:48.025 --> 06:51.705
Shang Zhitao, you'd better
understand the situation.

06:52.305 --> 06:54.425
If the Hangzhou project fails,

06:55.025 --> 06:56.465
you'll be the first one out.

07:05.345 --> 07:06.305
Dony,

07:07.825 --> 07:11.265
if you're only asking me why Lumi came,

07:12.465 --> 07:15.745
I honestly don't know,
so I have nothing to tell you.

07:17.025 --> 07:20.705
But if you're talking
about whether I'll stay at Lime,

07:20.785 --> 07:23.105
I don't think
that's yours alone to decide.

07:26.225 --> 07:27.265
I'm leaving.

07:33.705 --> 07:34.625
What are you doing?

07:41.065 --> 07:42.545
Keep this up, and I'll scream.

07:43.585 --> 07:44.505
Go ahead.

07:45.065 --> 07:46.065
See if anyone can hear you.

07:49.625 --> 07:53.705
I don't understand
what's so great about Luan Nian.

07:54.225 --> 07:56.145
You've only moved up
two levels in two years.

07:56.665 --> 07:59.465
Work for me, and I'll fast-track you
when we're back in Beijing.

07:59.545 --> 08:01.425
You won't have to work
yourself to the bone.

08:02.385 --> 08:04.105
Do you really need to resort to this?

08:08.745 --> 08:10.225
The means don't matter.

08:11.145 --> 08:12.425
Only the result does.

08:16.505 --> 08:17.745
Let go of me!

09:30.225 --> 09:32.665
LUAN NIAN

09:45.745 --> 09:47.425
LUAN NIAN

10:15.225 --> 10:17.145
LUAN NIAN

10:18.945 --> 10:19.785
Luan Nian.

10:21.265 --> 10:22.705
When are you coming back?

10:26.145 --> 10:27.345
I miss you.

10:31.265 --> 10:32.705
Your dog's about to revolt.

10:39.025 --> 10:40.945
I'll straighten him out when I get back.

10:45.585 --> 10:46.905
Is work in Hangzhou going well?

10:49.505 --> 10:50.425
It's OK.

10:51.625 --> 10:53.465
It's just a bit messy.

10:53.545 --> 10:55.865
I need to sort it out.

11:02.705 --> 11:03.665
One question.

11:04.745 --> 11:05.945
Has Dony ever harassed you?

11:08.265 --> 11:09.385
No.

11:09.465 --> 11:10.625
Why do you ask?

11:11.505 --> 11:12.785
Because at Lime,

11:12.865 --> 11:16.025
you look like the easiest person
to control and push around.

11:24.745 --> 11:26.065
Aren't you angry?

11:32.105 --> 11:32.945
No.

11:33.025 --> 11:34.665
Dony is bad news.

11:35.185 --> 11:36.625
If he ever crosses a line,

11:37.425 --> 11:38.545
tell me.

11:42.105 --> 11:43.065
Don't worry.

11:44.465 --> 11:45.465
He wouldn't dare.

11:46.305 --> 11:47.225
Come back soon.

12:08.545 --> 12:09.745
Flora.

12:55.185 --> 12:57.145
He took nude photos of me
and threatened me with them.

13:04.705 --> 13:05.825
That night,

13:06.545 --> 13:08.305
after the project celebration dinner,

13:09.505 --> 13:10.905
I was drunk.

13:12.465 --> 13:14.345
He took me back to my room.

13:15.265 --> 13:16.985
I was barely conscious.

13:17.585 --> 13:19.065
I felt so cold.

13:19.985 --> 13:20.905
When I woke up,

13:23.785 --> 13:25.265
I realized I had no clothes on.

13:26.465 --> 13:28.025
He was taking pictures of me.

13:28.905 --> 13:32.905
I tried to grab his phone,
but he pinned me…

13:34.665 --> 13:35.945
pinned me down on the bed.

13:36.705 --> 13:38.625
He tried to force himself on me.

13:39.905 --> 13:42.225
I fought with everything I had and barely…

13:43.025 --> 13:44.385
barely managed to stop him.

13:45.145 --> 13:46.505
Then he tried to coax me.

13:47.985 --> 13:49.545
He said if I behaved

13:50.105 --> 13:51.345
and did as I was told,

13:52.425 --> 13:54.065
he could take me straight to the top.

13:54.145 --> 13:57.025
He also said this was how things worked
with his previous secretary.

13:57.105 --> 13:58.425
That's when I knew he'd done it before.

13:59.945 --> 14:03.305
Just now, I actually
thought of asking you to…

14:04.625 --> 14:05.665
I'm sorry.

14:07.865 --> 14:09.025
It's OK.

14:09.625 --> 14:10.665
Let's go to the police.

14:12.185 --> 14:14.305
No. We can't go to the police.

14:14.905 --> 14:16.785
He still has the photos.
We can't report him.

14:16.865 --> 14:20.385
If he releases them, my life will be over.

14:23.785 --> 14:26.465
If I'm not his only victim,

14:26.545 --> 14:28.985
all the other victims' lives
will be ruined too.

14:30.065 --> 14:32.945
I don't know what I did wrong.

14:35.025 --> 14:36.345
You did nothing wrong.

14:36.425 --> 14:37.785
He's the one at fault.

14:38.425 --> 14:42.025
He's vile and disgusting,
hypocritical and depraved.

14:42.105 --> 14:42.945
VOICE MEMOS

14:43.025 --> 14:44.425
He has to pay for what he did.

14:51.065 --> 14:52.225
Keep this up, and I'll scream.

14:52.305 --> 14:53.745
KITTY

14:57.025 --> 14:58.345
I know you have your concerns.

15:00.265 --> 15:02.585
But trust me. Trust us.

15:09.265 --> 15:10.465
Don't be afraid.

15:12.945 --> 15:14.785
No matter how powerful he is,

15:14.865 --> 15:16.665
he must be punished.

15:56.345 --> 15:59.265
Turns out courage
isn't the absence of fear.

15:59.865 --> 16:01.385
It's acting even when you're afraid.

16:32.865 --> 16:34.345
Why are you back so suddenly?

16:41.705 --> 16:42.865
I missed you.

16:43.785 --> 16:45.785
I wanted to see you today.

16:46.905 --> 16:47.865
What's wrong?

16:50.305 --> 16:51.585
What happened?

16:53.825 --> 16:54.665
Luan Nian.

16:59.065 --> 17:00.105
Luan Nian.

17:02.185 --> 17:03.145
I'm here.

17:19.785 --> 17:21.944
The rollout data
fell short of expectations.

17:27.265 --> 17:28.305
Headquarters recommends

17:28.385 --> 17:30.705
we focus on operations in Beijing

17:32.825 --> 17:35.185
and recall the Hangzhou team for now.

17:43.025 --> 17:43.905
Luke.

17:44.945 --> 17:45.785
Don't you think

17:47.185 --> 17:49.305
it's too soon to draw a final conclusion?

17:49.385 --> 17:55.505
I'll email Headquarters
and ask them to reassess the project.

17:55.585 --> 17:58.345
Let's hold off
on recalling the Hangzhou team.

18:00.025 --> 18:02.105
I understand how much work you've put
into this new business expansion.

18:02.825 --> 18:06.185
Hangzhou can still support
our New Media network in the future.

18:06.785 --> 18:09.305
But for now, the team must return.

18:09.905 --> 18:12.305
Why should they return
just because you say so?

18:32.465 --> 18:33.985
Let's pause the meeting.

18:44.425 --> 18:45.505
COMPLAINT: I AM FLORA SHANG

18:45.585 --> 18:47.025
I AM FILING A FORMAL COMPLAINT AGAINST
DONY CHEN FOR SEXUAL HARASSMENT

18:51.705 --> 18:53.305
I AM FORMALLY REPORTING DONY CHEN

18:53.385 --> 18:55.345
FOR SEXUALLY HARASSING
AND COERCING ME AT WORK

18:59.425 --> 19:00.625
EXTREME FEAR

19:00.705 --> 19:01.745
SEXUAL HARASSMENT AND WORKPLACE COERCION

19:01.825 --> 19:03.105
HE PLACED HIS HAND RIGHT BESIDE MY NECK

19:06.425 --> 19:08.745
Flora's recording is attached as well.

19:08.825 --> 19:09.825
AUDIO EVIDENCE.MP3

19:11.265 --> 19:14.225
That day in Hangzhou,
he insisted on taking me to dinner,

19:15.225 --> 19:16.425
saying he had work arrangements
to discuss.

19:16.505 --> 19:17.385
AUDIO EVIDENCE

19:17.465 --> 19:18.425
So I went.

19:19.465 --> 19:22.025
Then he tried to entice and threaten me

19:22.545 --> 19:24.505
into handing over
confidential information.

19:25.185 --> 19:28.905
If the Hangzhou project fails,
you'll be the first one out.

19:34.905 --> 19:36.065
Keep this up, and I'll scream.

19:36.145 --> 19:38.185
Go ahead. See if anyone can hear you.

19:38.945 --> 19:41.345
Work for me, and I'll fast-track you
when we're back in Beijing.

19:41.425 --> 19:43.185
You won't have to work yourself
to the bone.

19:44.905 --> 19:46.105
Let go of me!

19:54.185 --> 19:56.105
THROUGHOUT THE FLIGHT HOME
I COULDN'T STOP SHAKING

19:59.425 --> 20:00.305
Hold me.

20:00.825 --> 20:01.665
Hold me tight.

20:02.545 --> 20:03.545
Luan Nian.

20:04.905 --> 20:06.065
Luan Nian.

20:07.745 --> 20:08.905
Even now,

20:09.865 --> 20:13.185
thinking back on it
still fills me with fear.

20:13.745 --> 20:15.385
The evidence is attached below.

20:15.465 --> 20:17.545
I respectfully ask the company
to launch an investigation.

20:17.625 --> 20:18.545
Don't leave!

20:19.185 --> 20:20.425
-Don't leave!
-Let go of me.

20:20.505 --> 20:22.065
-Are you even human?
-Let go of me.

20:22.145 --> 20:23.225
-This has nothing to do with you.
-Don't leave!

20:23.305 --> 20:25.145
You're not leaving
until you explain yourself.

20:25.225 --> 20:26.305
I'm telling you.

20:27.105 --> 20:28.065
You're not leaving!

20:28.985 --> 20:30.265
-I have nothing to say to you, OK?
-Where do you think you're going?

20:30.345 --> 20:31.345
-Apologize!
-Let go!

20:31.425 --> 20:32.665
-I said apologize!
-Let go of me!

20:32.745 --> 20:33.865
Luke, don't do anything rash.

20:35.545 --> 20:36.585
What kind of scum are you?

20:37.985 --> 20:39.705
All you do is prey on and harass women.

20:40.505 --> 20:41.705
You make me sick.

20:41.785 --> 20:45.225
Luan Nian, you set me up, didn't you?

20:45.305 --> 20:46.305
Set you up?

20:46.825 --> 20:48.145
You're not worth the trouble.

20:48.865 --> 20:50.305
I could kill you right now.

21:10.665 --> 21:11.505
Call the police.

21:31.465 --> 21:32.985
I've been with Lime China

21:34.225 --> 21:35.225
for nine years.

21:36.305 --> 21:40.145
Our workforce is 45% men and 55% women.

21:40.225 --> 21:41.665
Our female employees

21:42.185 --> 21:45.545
have been at the forefront of Lime's
rapid growth in China.

21:47.345 --> 21:51.985
I never imagined something like this
could happen at our company.

21:58.185 --> 22:01.825
Flora's email broke my heart.

22:05.385 --> 22:07.065
As a woman,

22:07.945 --> 22:10.385
I'm deeply saddened
by what Flora went through.

22:12.745 --> 22:13.945
This time…

22:16.665 --> 22:18.065
we have to call the police.

22:19.185 --> 22:20.265
Yes.

22:20.345 --> 22:21.505
We should call the police.

22:22.025 --> 22:22.865
Call the police.

22:22.945 --> 22:24.505
Someone like him must be punished.

22:43.425 --> 22:45.265
Dony has powerful connections.

22:45.345 --> 22:48.465
We don't know how far
the investigation will go.

22:51.105 --> 22:52.585
But I want to make one thing clear.

22:52.665 --> 22:55.785
Luke and I will make sure
he goes to prison.

22:58.625 --> 22:59.465
I know.

23:00.305 --> 23:01.225
I'm not afraid.

23:02.065 --> 23:04.185
I just want him
to be punished for what he did.

23:07.825 --> 23:11.145
Flora, the first time I met you,

23:11.225 --> 23:14.265
I knew you were
an extraordinary young woman.

23:15.265 --> 23:17.345
I went against everyone else to hire you.

23:18.865 --> 23:22.585
Looking back, it was a great decision.

23:25.305 --> 23:26.345
Thank you.

23:27.625 --> 23:29.185
Thank you for always believing in me.

23:40.705 --> 23:41.865
Ms. Shang,

23:42.465 --> 23:46.905
Headquarters takes the complaint you filed
against Dony Chen very seriously.

23:46.985 --> 23:48.545
But the situation now

23:48.625 --> 23:52.425
is extremely complicated
and highly sensitive.

23:53.025 --> 23:54.185
Although the police
have opened a criminal case,

23:54.265 --> 23:55.785
this is ultimately
an internal matter at Lime.

23:55.865 --> 23:58.985
Issuing a public statement
could cause immeasurable damage

23:59.065 --> 24:01.105
to the company's reputation
and share price.

24:01.185 --> 24:02.705
We understand what you've been through,

24:02.785 --> 24:05.745
but we still hope you'll settle the matter
privately within the company.

24:06.545 --> 24:07.385
Of course,

24:07.465 --> 24:10.425
the company is prepared to offer you
substantial financial compensation

24:10.505 --> 24:11.505
and job security.

24:14.105 --> 24:15.785
Thank you for the offer,

24:16.545 --> 24:18.385
but what I want is justice.

24:19.225 --> 24:22.825
Agreeing to a settlement
would allow a criminal

24:22.905 --> 24:24.105
to continue to walk free.

24:24.185 --> 24:26.305
I trust the company
won't handle it that way.

24:26.385 --> 24:29.705
But the recording you submitted
doesn't clearly establish what happened.

24:29.785 --> 24:31.185
It alone isn't enough
to secure a conviction.

24:35.225 --> 24:39.145
What I want is for Dony Chen
to be punished for sexual harassment.

24:39.665 --> 24:40.665
Just because he got away with it before

24:40.745 --> 24:42.785
doesn't mean every woman
is an easy target.

24:43.465 --> 24:44.785
I won't settle.

24:53.905 --> 24:54.945
This contains evidence

24:55.545 --> 24:57.705
that he tried to force himself on me
and sexually harassed me.

25:04.065 --> 25:05.425
I was instructed to trace the funds

25:05.505 --> 25:08.905
flowing through the high-end tea shops
Dony selected and Lanyuan.

25:09.505 --> 25:13.065
The money ultimately went
into a private overseas account.

25:35.945 --> 25:38.585
These are the materials
I gathered for my complaint against Dony.

26:14.345 --> 26:15.745
A recording isn't foolproof.

26:16.745 --> 26:18.945
What if things had gotten out of control?

26:20.625 --> 26:23.865
I'd already made arrangements
with Kitty and Lucy.

26:25.025 --> 26:26.505
I knew I wouldn't be in any danger.

26:29.185 --> 26:30.825
You were in Hangzhou for 13 days.

26:31.745 --> 26:34.025
We spoke on the phone 26 times.

26:34.625 --> 26:37.025
Yet you never said a word
about any of this.

26:39.985 --> 26:41.105
I want to know why.

26:43.705 --> 26:46.705
You were already under intense scrutiny.

26:46.785 --> 26:49.585
I… I didn't want
to cause you more trouble.

26:59.425 --> 27:01.505
Correct me if I'm wrong, but I asked you.

27:02.505 --> 27:04.225
I asked whether Dony had harassed you,

27:04.945 --> 27:05.985
and you said no.

27:12.185 --> 27:13.465
Good for you, Shang Zhitao.

27:14.545 --> 27:18.225
You're so strong now
that you don't need anyone to protect you.

27:19.425 --> 27:21.065
Clearheaded and independent.

27:21.945 --> 27:23.905
I can hardly resist applauding you.

27:30.065 --> 27:31.065
Luan Nian.

27:35.225 --> 27:36.625
I'm exhausted. I…

27:36.705 --> 27:38.505
I just want to go home and sleep.

27:41.785 --> 27:43.025
You've certainly been through a lot.

27:43.545 --> 27:44.705
Go home and rest.

28:08.705 --> 28:10.065
Good for you, Shang Zhitao.

28:10.145 --> 28:14.065
You're so strong now
that you don't need anyone to protect you.

28:33.865 --> 28:34.945
It's over now.

28:35.025 --> 28:36.065
Everything's OK.

28:53.945 --> 28:54.865
You're here, right?

28:55.825 --> 28:57.265
I'll bring her down now.

29:10.025 --> 29:11.705
According to our investigation,

29:11.785 --> 29:13.905
Dony may be involved
in more than just this case.

29:14.425 --> 29:16.385
There is also evidence of embezzlement
and other illegal activity.

29:16.465 --> 29:18.505
Dony was hired by Headquarters,

29:18.585 --> 29:21.105
and his background check
was never handled by Lime China.

29:21.185 --> 29:23.345
The group also made a serious error
in appointing him.

29:25.945 --> 29:28.945
None of the materials you've provided
have been verified.

29:29.025 --> 29:31.425
Some are even complaint records
from years ago,

29:31.505 --> 29:33.985
from different companies
with different systems.

29:34.505 --> 29:35.505
Moreover,

29:35.585 --> 29:39.785
none of them resulted in any substantive
disciplinary action or legal consequences.

29:40.505 --> 29:44.785
Luke, you and Dony disagreed
over the New Media strategy.

29:44.865 --> 29:45.985
If you use company resources

29:46.065 --> 29:48.105
to investigate his private life
from years ago because of that,

29:48.705 --> 29:50.225
it'll be a serious breach
of management principles

29:50.305 --> 29:51.865
and could constitute
an abuse of authority.

29:51.945 --> 29:55.065
Of course, we will review
the matter carefully,

29:55.665 --> 29:59.745
but we must also consider the company's
overall stability and reputation.

30:03.865 --> 30:06.185
I don't know whose interests
Dony truly represents,

30:06.825 --> 30:10.585
but this disastrous appointment
proves the company has no trust in me.

30:15.785 --> 30:18.145
Today, I resign
from every position I hold at Lime.

31:47.385 --> 31:48.065
Hello?

31:48.145 --> 31:49.785
The board is in an uproar.

31:49.865 --> 31:51.545
They want you online for a meeting.

31:51.625 --> 31:52.745
I'm not going.

31:54.705 --> 31:56.105
People are already
talking about it online,

31:56.185 --> 31:57.745
and the share price is falling.

31:58.265 --> 31:59.145
Serves them right.

32:01.025 --> 32:02.025
So,

32:03.345 --> 32:04.265
are you really resigning?

32:04.865 --> 32:05.705
Yes.

32:10.025 --> 32:11.785
It's fine to teach them a lesson,

32:11.865 --> 32:15.385
but resigning wasn't part of our plan.

32:16.865 --> 32:18.545
I'm not trying to teach them a lesson.

32:19.065 --> 32:20.625
I really am resigning.

32:21.825 --> 32:22.985
Are you sure you're serious?

32:23.065 --> 32:24.265
I am.

32:25.385 --> 32:26.985
Tell the board
to find a replacement quickly.

32:27.065 --> 32:28.745
I'm taking leave starting today.

32:48.745 --> 32:53.225
The flight from Hangzhou to Beijing
covers 1,520 kilometers.

32:54.345 --> 32:55.905
I was trembling the entire way.

32:57.105 --> 32:58.785
Keep this up, and I'll scream.

32:58.865 --> 33:00.065
Let go of me!

33:01.585 --> 33:04.465
You were already under intense scrutiny.

33:04.545 --> 33:06.345
I didn't want to cause you more trouble.

33:18.385 --> 33:19.225
SHANG ZHITAO

33:24.465 --> 33:25.625
Hello?

33:25.705 --> 33:26.585
Hello?

33:27.265 --> 33:29.265
Hello. This is Luan Nian.

33:30.105 --> 33:31.505
May I speak to Shang Zhitao?

33:32.225 --> 33:33.545
Tao is asleep.

33:36.425 --> 33:37.785
She's exhausted.

33:38.545 --> 33:41.505
When she wakes up,
I'll tell her you called.

33:41.585 --> 33:43.345
-OK?
-OK.

33:44.665 --> 33:45.545
Thank you.

33:59.545 --> 34:04.745
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

34:21.824 --> 34:22.665
Hello?

34:22.744 --> 34:24.824
Sun Yu said you called me.

34:26.905 --> 34:27.784
I did.

34:28.425 --> 34:29.505
What is it?

34:31.585 --> 34:32.585
I came to apologize.

34:35.585 --> 34:36.865
I'm downstairs.

34:47.824 --> 34:49.625
There's no rush. Take your time.

36:28.905 --> 36:30.145
I want to see the moon.

36:36.865 --> 36:37.705
OK.

36:58.745 --> 37:01.025
Kitty said she was terrified.

37:03.905 --> 37:04.905
Were you scared?

37:19.825 --> 37:20.945
We agreed

37:21.905 --> 37:23.185
to be honest with each other.

37:25.745 --> 37:27.785
But you had plenty of people around you,

37:27.865 --> 37:30.305
so you never needed to ask me for help.

37:31.225 --> 37:32.985
You wouldn't even tell me the truth.

37:35.305 --> 37:37.305
I didn't feel it was my place to tell you.

37:38.105 --> 37:40.825
It involved Kitty's privacy.

37:40.905 --> 37:42.705
Then why was it your place to tell others?

37:43.665 --> 37:44.825
Who do you mean?

37:45.545 --> 37:48.065
Throughout all of this,
I was the last to know.

37:50.265 --> 37:51.505
Shang Zhitao.

37:52.505 --> 37:54.065
Do you even see me as your boyfriend?

37:55.785 --> 37:58.905
Luan Nian, don't talk like that.

37:59.705 --> 38:01.545
Of course I see you as my boyfriend.

38:15.265 --> 38:16.305
Luan Nian.

38:20.785 --> 38:21.945
I've learned my lesson.

38:23.425 --> 38:24.665
It won't happen again.

38:51.505 --> 38:52.345
Your punishment.

38:59.785 --> 39:03.305
Lumi said you're resigning?

39:06.745 --> 39:08.065
Because of me?

39:08.145 --> 39:09.545
Because I'm rich.

39:10.065 --> 39:12.025
I can quit whenever I want.

39:18.225 --> 39:22.625
Could you not resign
and keep being my boss?

39:23.545 --> 39:25.345
I like working with you.

39:25.865 --> 39:27.825
I feel like I learn a lot.

39:28.345 --> 39:29.905
And…

39:32.825 --> 39:34.905
I get to see you often.

40:11.745 --> 40:13.545
LMAD STOCK PRICE

40:29.425 --> 40:31.305
Luke, when are you going back to work?

40:34.705 --> 40:35.545
I'm not.

40:37.345 --> 40:40.105
Running this bar must cost quite a bit.

40:42.145 --> 40:43.305
It's manageable.

40:43.385 --> 40:45.665
I can afford it.

40:46.905 --> 40:47.745
Luke,

40:47.825 --> 40:51.145
you can have full control
of Lime China from now on.

40:51.225 --> 40:53.185
You've all come all the way from the US.

40:53.265 --> 40:55.025
I know it wasn't an easy trip.

40:55.105 --> 40:56.145
Enjoy yourselves tonight.

40:56.225 --> 40:57.665
The drinks are on me.

40:57.745 --> 40:59.225
Then go back and get some sleep.

40:59.305 --> 41:00.465
Just name your terms.

41:02.065 --> 41:04.465
Then process my resignation
as soon as possible.

41:08.385 --> 41:09.225
Luke,

41:09.985 --> 41:12.185
we came here in good faith.

41:12.265 --> 41:14.425
Why don't you tell us
what you have in mind?

41:15.905 --> 41:18.465
What Dony did
caused our employees great harm.

41:19.065 --> 41:20.985
If the group won't even offer
a sincere apology,

41:21.505 --> 41:23.025
how can our employees feel secure?

41:25.465 --> 41:26.985
Yes. Right.

41:27.545 --> 41:28.625
We completely agree.

41:31.505 --> 41:32.345
How about this?

41:32.865 --> 41:34.905
Tell us what you propose.

41:34.985 --> 41:36.105
We'll do it.

41:41.065 --> 41:42.065
I have two proposals.

41:43.385 --> 41:47.065
The complainants have the legal right
not to withdraw the case.

41:47.145 --> 41:48.185
First,

41:48.745 --> 41:51.825
as an apology, the company will grant
immediately exercisable stock options

41:52.665 --> 41:55.425
worth 200,000 yuan to the lead complainant

41:55.505 --> 41:57.265
and options worth 100,000 yuan
to each of the other four.

41:57.905 --> 42:00.225
It will be treated
as a confidential special award.

42:00.785 --> 42:01.625
Second,

42:02.865 --> 42:05.585
the group must not interfere
in personnel appointments at Lime China.

42:07.185 --> 42:09.225
They won't withdraw the case,
and we're compensating them?

42:13.745 --> 42:15.585
The complainants' lives
may even be at risk.

42:16.105 --> 42:17.385
If they go to the press with the details,

42:18.465 --> 42:19.625
Lime's stock could hit

42:20.345 --> 42:21.945
its daily loss limit
for five straight days.

42:26.545 --> 42:27.865
Go back and discuss it.

42:27.945 --> 42:30.465
Handle it properly, and I'll return.

42:48.145 --> 42:50.465
Are you firing me?

42:52.465 --> 42:54.185
You're so good at your job. Why would we?

42:54.825 --> 42:55.825
Take a look.

43:00.625 --> 43:02.505
STOCK GRANT AGREEMENT

43:03.465 --> 43:07.785
You know the company awards stock
to certain employees every year, right?

43:08.465 --> 43:10.785
Aren't stock awards
only for specialist-level employees?

43:10.865 --> 43:14.145
This is a special stock award
from the company.

43:14.225 --> 43:15.705
I didn't do it for money.

43:16.985 --> 43:18.185
Don't worry.

43:18.705 --> 43:20.465
The grant will be confidential.

43:21.705 --> 43:26.865
Thank you for making our workplace safer.

43:26.945 --> 43:29.865
Without your courage and resourcefulness,

43:29.945 --> 43:31.585
he wouldn't have been brought to justice.

43:34.825 --> 43:35.665
Here.

43:47.505 --> 43:49.225
Thank you, Tracy.

43:52.105 --> 43:55.225
This was also one of Luke's conditions
for returning to work.

44:03.385 --> 44:05.465
Thanks to Flora's persistence,

44:05.545 --> 44:07.225
Dony has received
the punishment he deserved.

44:07.305 --> 44:08.865
With the evidence we provided,

44:08.945 --> 44:12.505
he was convicted of embezzlement
and forcible indecency and insult,

44:12.585 --> 44:14.665
and sentenced to 11 years in prison.

44:15.345 --> 44:16.225
You can come back now.

44:16.305 --> 44:17.585
Stay away much longer,

44:17.665 --> 44:20.425
and the board might replace you outright.

44:21.345 --> 44:22.265
That'd be great.

44:22.785 --> 44:25.465
I'll start another company
and steal Lime's business.

44:28.145 --> 44:30.225
Come back to work, my junior brother.

44:31.785 --> 44:32.705
Next week.

44:43.825 --> 44:44.785
Luke.

44:47.305 --> 44:48.145
Paw.

44:50.545 --> 44:51.505
Silly.

44:53.545 --> 44:54.945
Stay. Sit.

45:17.785 --> 45:18.945
I'm doomed.

45:19.025 --> 45:22.185
New user sign-ups hit another record low.

45:22.265 --> 45:24.665
I've almost burned through
all the investors' money.

45:24.745 --> 45:28.745
What was I thinking,
trying to start a business?

45:31.145 --> 45:32.865
Everything takes time.

45:32.945 --> 45:33.945
Don't rush.

45:34.025 --> 45:36.705
I've tried every kind of promotion,

45:36.785 --> 45:38.225
but nothing's working.

45:38.305 --> 45:39.625
What do I do?

45:43.585 --> 45:44.665
Tell you what.

45:44.745 --> 45:46.585
I'll sign up right now and download it.

45:46.665 --> 45:47.865
Zhu, download it too.

45:47.945 --> 45:49.345
Every user counts.

45:49.425 --> 45:51.265
And we're real, live users.

45:51.345 --> 45:53.345
When Lei gets back,
we'll have him download it too.

45:53.425 --> 45:55.665
And I'll promote it at work. OK?

45:56.305 --> 45:57.385
Really?

45:58.625 --> 46:02.545
Having you two as users
is a huge win for me.

46:03.545 --> 46:06.505
Don't worry. I can limp along
for another month.

46:07.105 --> 46:09.905
If I really go broke,
I'll be counting on you two for meals.

46:10.505 --> 46:13.025
You won't go broke. It'll work out.

46:14.865 --> 46:15.705
It'll work out.

46:15.785 --> 46:16.785
Say something different.

46:16.865 --> 46:18.105
You won't go broke.

46:18.745 --> 46:19.585
See?

46:21.705 --> 46:25.705
Luke, your other mom's about to go broke.

46:25.785 --> 46:28.265
I'll have to eat your dog food.

46:28.345 --> 46:29.305
STAY HAPPY TODAY
